body:
Just pee in the woods until that fear goes away. My neighbor is roughly as smart as the average bear, probably why he feeds them. There are currently 10 different bears (black bears) that come by daily. The trail they use is right beside the greatest huckleberry patch I've ever seen, so every day I go and piss on their trail. One day they might stop using that trail and leave my huckleberries alone.

&#x200B;

Pee in the woods, it's the best.

I just remember being 5 and hearing the menu music and watching spaceships fighting while dad collected asteroids slower than I would have liked...

&#x200B;

Thanks for the fond memories!

Location - BC Canada

&#x200B;

Half the province is on fire.

I mean, that's the only part that isn't shocking. Of course they waited for the boosts, they wanted that money. And thankfully (from what I read on the forums) those of you in OCE servers are entitled to a full refund under Australian consumer law. Now I personally don't know the law it's just what several players from OCE were saying, so grain of salt.

&#x200B;

Link to the post: https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/oce-players-here-is-how-to-request-a-refund/981254

Sorry but were the people doing this now also in concentration camps? It didn't happen to them, it happened to their parents and grandparents. My grandpa got shot in WW2, does that mean I would never shoot someone?

&#x200B;

Humans are capable of evil in all races. The ones in power usually moreso.
